// The lock curve as it stood before ADR 0013 replaced it: geometric, growing
// x4.00 per ten floors against per-kill gold's x2.478. Kept so the failure it
// produced stays reproducible -- the lock line falls permanently behind the
// wall, climbers trail it by ~82 floors, and the per-type ceiling ends up
// setting the crowd size in violation of ADR 0011.
//
// `lock_free_below_best` is off because it did not exist then; leaving it on
// would make this reproduce nothing in particular.
(prestige_basis: Peak, lock_pricing: Geometric, lock_free_below_best: false, lock_cost0: 500.0, lock_cost_base: 4.0)
